  "body": "## Summary\n\nPR2697 leaves serialized-control storage outside its numerical first-node reserve. This adds one source-bound component for its unchanged coefficient evaluator at `a53fdf4bcbe33c6732f0bec1badc8c023380f9d1`.\n\n```text\nA = 2I+4, B = R+3, T = max(A,B)\nF(h) = (h+1)T+hB\nlive continuation symbols <= F(h), plus four LEFT markers\nretained backing cells <= 2F(h)+T+B+2\n```\n\nThe written all-depth induction includes waiting siblings, returned values, partial pushes and copy-before-erase in `Stack.pop`. Grammar sharpness is separate from selected-catalogue membership. The package contains proof, exact source exports and hashes, fixed receipts, behavioral controls and a registered replay. It changes only `research/selected-continuation-storage/`.\n\nCredit Jose Manuel/jmbarrancoml's PR2697 and PR2332 control compiler, with the retained source notice unchanged. PR2749 counts cardinality tapes, PR2743 payload/key lifetimes, starship-s's PR2731 residual content, and ywz65's PR2688 directory storage. The scope change from `selected-stock-envelope` and overlap evidence are recorded in TASK.json. [Canonical claim and handoff](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/discussions/2319#discussioncomment-18957960).\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Before, the continuation grammar had an asymptotic allowance without this serialized coefficient. After, 12 binary cases attain the exact live bound. Blank retained buffers require a separate allowance.\n- Registered CPython 3.12.15 normal and optimized replay passes 524 control fixtures and three literal 64-dimensional matrix/constructor fixtures. Their live peaks are exactly 20, 70 and 144 symbols. Exact returned coefficients, every stack write, preserved program/field bytes, erased temporaries and restored heads are checked.\n- Eight behavioral groups pass, including underbudget, backing-space, malformed-record, source/import and typed-receipt controls. Internal review caught a stale-bytecode gap; the verifier now compiles its authenticated source bytes and the regression passes. The repository research-workflow suite completes 70 tests with three skips.\n- This is a per-evaluator component under successful source/word contracts. Numerical arenas, input program/fields, simultaneous callbacks, physical placement, total reserve and larger returns remain open. No supplier, kappa, formal-kernel or hosted-CI claim.\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -Werror -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/selected-continuation-storage\n```\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way\n\nAdditive research package with frozen predecessor inputs.\n\n**Blast Radius:** research\n\nProduction suppliers and selected-result files are unchanged.\n",
